{
  "_comment": [
    "The campaign's SECOND ratchet (api-1.0-campaign.md \u00a7Ratchets), measured",
    "2026-07-30. Specified when the campaign was written and never built until",
    "slice F needed it.",
    "",
    "\u26a0 FROZEN AS A SET, by stable schema name \u2014 never as a count. The campaign's",
    "own warning: 'Freezing only the NUMBER of central rollback registrations",
    "permits deleting one and adding another.' Same two invariants as the module",
    "allowlist: the set may not GAIN a member, and it may not KEEP one that has",
    "left, so a federating migration must prune in its own commit.",
    "",
    "ZERO means rollback ownership is federated \u2014 every domain owns its own",
    "`RollbackSchemaFragment` and `ambition_runtime` is no longer the",
    "implementation owner of every domain's snapshot.",
    "",
    "\u26a0 THE CAMPAIGN CITED THE WRONG FILE for the codec half. \u00a7Ratchets says 'the",
    "codecs in rollback/codecs.rs'; that file's `pub fn`s are four reconciliation",
    "helpers. The codecs are its 65 `impl SnapshotState` blocks, which is what is",
    "frozen here. A citation nobody re-read, exactly the class",
    "check_roadmap_evidence.py exists for."
  ],
